    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d30">

                <pb facs="0115" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg23"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Marshal Stalin to President Roosevelt</hi><anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d30-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-09-08">September 8, 1943</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">Translation</p>
                <p>Personal and secret message from Premier J. V. Stalin to President Franklin D.
                    Roosevelt</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <pb facs="0116" n="24" xml:id="pg24"/>
                <p>Third. As to our personal meeting with participation of Mr. Churchill I am also
                    interested to have it arranged as soon as possible. Your proposal regarding the
                    time of the meeting seems to me acceptable. I consider that it would be
                    expedient to choose as the place of the meeting the country where there are the
                    representations of all three countries, for instance, Iran. However, I have to
                    say that the exact date of the meeting has to be defined later taking into
                    consideration the situation on the Soviet-German front where more than 500
                    divisions are engaged in the righting in all, and where the control on the part
                    of the High Command of the USSR is needed almost daily.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">September</hi> 8, 1943.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d30-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d30-f1-content">
                <p>Apparently sent via the Soviet Embassy, Washington. The entire document is
                    printed in <hi rendition="#italic">Stalin’s Correspondence</hi>, vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 90.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
